@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<https://www.glossarist.org/dpp/dataset/dpp/concept/dpp-0137>
  a skos:Concept ;
  skos:notation "dpp-0137" ;
  skos:prefLabel "escrowed disclosure"@eng ;
  skos:definition "edge visibility arrangement in which information concealed by a blind edge (concept dpp-0136) is deposited with a threshold trustee and released only through a disclosure ceremony — court, regulator or consent"@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "The installation schema records escrow as none or trustee, with declared audiences."@eng ;
  skos:scopeNote "An escrow envelope under a threshold trustee may optionally accompany a proof of binding (concept dpp-0138), preserving verifiability while full disclosure remains ceremonial."@eng
 .